/P 47 0 R
/E (Our Director and a team member had the opportunity to attend the AI for Social Impact \(AI4SI\) Masterclass at IIT Madras Research Park, organized by Shooting Stars Foundation, Right Dots, and partners. The workshop provided practical insights into leveraging AI for greater social impact. Sessions covered prompt engineering, AI agents and automation, emerging AI technologies, and responsible AI governance. A proud moment for our team was receiving recognition for the Best CSR Proposal Prompt. The experience reinforced a powerful message: AI is no longer just a digital skill; it is a life skill. We are excited to integrate AI-driven solutions to enhance efficiency, accessibility, independence, and dignity for the communities we serve.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
